K     DC    4
AGAIN READ  V
      LOAD  V
      BG    PLUS
      BL    MINUS
      STORE S
      BU    SHOW
PLUS  LOAD  =1
      STORE S
      BU    SHOW
MINUS LOAD  =-1
      STORE S
SHOW  PRINT S
      LOAD  K
      SUB   =1
      STORE K
      BE    STOP
      BU    AGAIN
STOP  END
